OL,3,GNEWSAKeeping prison closed 'crazy' says
OL,4,ATory deputy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prison Service said it continued to
OL,7,F"consider the safety and practicality"
OL,8,Fof re-opening the jail and would "make
OL,9,Fa decision on the site in due course".
